Subject: [LOCAL SP12 r2] media: i2c: manage OV13858 AFVDD and correct OV02C10 MCLK

Local source-backed adaptation after preserved overlay patches 01-06. Keep
original overlay patch files and notices unchanged. Adds the DT-described
OV13858 AFVDD rail to the existing bulk regulator set, and corrects the SP12
OV02C10 MCLK request to 19.2 MHz per the preserved reference correction.
No new author identity or DCO sign-off is asserted.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-microsoft-sp12in.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-microsoft-sp12in.dts
index c20c945..524d8da 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-microsoft-sp12in.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/x1p42100-microsoft-sp12in.dts
@@ -880,7 +880,7 @@
 
 		clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK4_CLK>;
 		assigned-clocks = <&camcc CAM_CC_MCLK4_CLK>;
-		assigned-clock-rates = <12000000>;
+		assigned-clock-rates = <19200000>;
 
 		orientation = <0>;
 
diff --git a/drivers/media/i2c/ov13858.c b/drivers/media/i2c/ov13858.c
